{"schemaVersion":2,"bookId":"mackay-information-theory-2003","title":"关于第 3 章","sourcePdfPages":[59,59],"toc":[{"number":"导页","title":"关于第 3 章","block":"p059-b001"}],"blocks":[{"pdfPage":59,"page":1,"kind":"heading","level":1,"text":"关于第 3 章","segments":["关于第 3 章"],"id":"p059-b001"},{"pdfPage":59,"page":1,"kind":"paragraph","text":"如果你迫不及待地想学习信息论、数据压缩和有噪声信道，可以先跳到第 4 章。不过，数据压缩与数据建模密切相关；因此，读到第 6 章时，你大概会想回来读这一章。在阅读第 3 章之前，先看一看下面的习题也许不错。","segments":["如果你迫不及待地想学习信息论、数据压缩和有噪声信道，可以先跳到第 4 章。不过，数据压缩与数据建模密切相关；因此，读到第 6 章时，你大概会想回来读这一章。在阅读第 3 章之前，先看一看下面的习题也许不错。"],"id":"p059-b002"},{"pdfPage":59,"page":1,"kind":"exercise","label":"▷ 习题 3.1","text":"〔难度 2；解答见原书印刷页 59〕从两枚二十面骰子中随机选一枚。骰子各面标有数字 1–10，但每个数字出现的次数并不相同：","segments":["〔难度 2；解答见原书印刷页 59〕从两枚二十面骰子中随机选一枚。骰子各面标有数字 1–10，但每个数字出现的次数并不相同："],"id":"p059-b003"},{"pdfPage":59,"page":1,"kind":"table","rows":[[{"text":"数字","segments":["数字"],"header":true},{"text":"1","segments":["1"],"header":true},{"text":"2","segments":["2"],"header":true},{"text":"3","segments":["3"],"header":true},{"text":"4","segments":["4"],"header":true},{"text":"5","segments":["5"],"header":true},{"text":"6","segments":["6"],"header":true},{"text":"7","segments":["7"],"header":true},{"text":"8","segments":["8"],"header":true},{"text":"9","segments":["9"],"header":true},{"text":"10","segments":["10"],"header":true}],[{"text":"骰子 A 上标有该数字的面数","segments":["骰子 A 上标有该数字的面数"],"header":false},{"text":"6","segments":["6"],"header":false},{"text":"4","segments":["4"],"header":false},{"text":"3","segments":["3"],"header":false},{"text":"2","segments":["2"],"header":false},{"text":"1","segments":["1"],"header":false},{"text":"1","segments":["1"],"header":false},{"text":"1","segments":["1"],"header":false},{"text":"1","segments":["1"],"header":false},{"text":"1","segments":["1"],"header":false},{"text":"0","segments":["0"],"header":false}],[{"text":"骰子 B 上标有该数字的面数","segments":["骰子 B 上标有该数字的面数"],"header":false},{"text":"3","segments":["3"],"header":false},{"text":"3","segments":["3"],"header":false},{"text":"2","segments":["2"],"header":false},{"text":"2","segments":["2"],"header":false},{"text":"2","segments":["2"],"header":false},{"text":"2","segments":["2"],"header":false},{"text":"2","segments":["2"],"header":false},{"text":"2","segments":["2"],"header":false},{"text":"1","segments":["1"],"header":false},{"text":"1","segments":["1"],"header":false}]],"id":"p059-b004","notation":true},{"pdfPage":59,"page":1,"kind":"paragraph","text":"将随机选出的骰子掷 7 次，结果依次为：$5,3,9,3,8,4,7$。选中的骰子是 A 的概率是多少？","segments":["将随机选出的骰子掷 7 次，结果依次为：",{"tex":"5,3,9,3,8,4,7","text":"5,3,9,3,8,4,7","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></math>"},"。选中的骰子是 A 的概率是多少？"],"id":"p059-b005"},{"pdfPage":59,"page":1,"kind":"exercise","label":"▷ 习题 3.2","text":"〔难度 2；解答见原书印刷页 59〕假设还有第三枚二十面骰子 C，数字 1–20 在它的各面上各出现一次。与上题一样，从三枚骰子中随机选一枚并掷 7 次，结果依次为：$3,5,4,8,3,9,7$。所选骰子分别是 (a) A、(b) B、(c) C 的概率是多少？","segments":["〔难度 2；解答见原书印刷页 59〕假设还有第三枚二十面骰子 C，数字 1–20 在它的各面上各出现一次。与上题一样，从三枚骰子中随机选一枚并掷 7 次，结果依次为：",{"tex":"3,5,4,8,3,9,7","text":"3,5,4,8,3,9,7","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></math>"},"。所选骰子分别是 (a) A、(b) B、(c) C 的概率是多少？"],"id":"p059-b006"},{"pdfPage":59,"page":1,"recommendedIcon":"assets/shared/exercise-rat.png","kind":"exercise","label":"习题 3.3","text":"〔难度 3；解答见原书印刷页 48〕推断衰变常数。不稳定粒子从一个源发出，在距离 $x$ 处衰变；$x$ 是服从指数概率分布的实数，该分布的特征长度为 $\\lambda$。只有发生在 $x=1\\,\\mathrm{cm}$ 到 $x=20\\,\\mathrm{cm}$ 的窗口内的衰变事件才能被观测到。在位置 $\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_N\\}$ 观测到 $N$ 次衰变。$\\lambda$ 是多少？","segments":["〔难度 3；解答见原书印刷页 48〕",{"strong":true,"text":"推断衰变常数。"},"不稳定粒子从一个源发出，在距离 ",{"tex":"x","text":"x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>"}," 处衰变；",{"tex":"x","text":"x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>"}," 是服从指数概率分布的实数，该分布的特征长度为 ",{"tex":"\\lambda","text":"\\lambda","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow></math>"},"。只有发生在 ",{"tex":"x=1\\,\\mathrm{cm}","text":"x=1\\,\\mathrm{cm}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mrow></math>"}," 到 ",{"tex":"x=20\\,\\mathrm{cm}","text":"x=20\\,\\mathrm{cm}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mrow></math>"}," 的窗口内的衰变事件才能被观测到。在位置 ",{"tex":"\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_N\\}","text":"\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_N\\}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></math>"}," 观测到 ",{"tex":"N","text":"N","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow></math>"}," 次衰变。",{"tex":"\\lambda","text":"\\lambda","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow></math>"}," 是多少？"],"id":"p059-b007"},{"pdfPage":59,"page":1,"kind":"figure","src":"assets/chapter-03/about-chapter-3-decay-window.png","width":615,"height":132,"alt":"衰变源、有限观测窗口、星号表示的衰变位置与距离 x","id":"p059-b008","wide":true},{"pdfPage":59,"page":1,"kind":"paragraph","text":"图内星号表示窗口中观测到的衰变位置；$x$ 表示距粒子源的距离。","segments":["图内星号表示窗口中观测到的衰变位置；",{"tex":"x","text":"x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>"}," 表示距粒子源的距离。"],"id":"p059-b009"},{"pdfPage":59,"page":1,"kind":"exercise","label":"▷ 习题 3.4","text":"〔难度 3；解答见原书印刷页 55〕法庭证据。两个人在犯罪现场留下了各自的血迹。嫌疑人奥利弗接受检测，血型为 O 型。现场两处血迹分别为 O 型（当地人口中常见，频率为 60%）和 AB 型（罕见，频率为 1%）。这些数据（现场发现 O 型和 AB 型血）是否支持“奥利弗是到过现场的两个人之一”这个命题？","segments":["〔难度 3；解答见原书印刷页 55〕",{"strong":true,"text":"法庭证据。"},"两个人在犯罪现场留下了各自的血迹。嫌疑人奥利弗接受检测，血型为 O 型。现场两处血迹分别为 O 型（当地人口中常见，频率为 60%）和 AB 型（罕见，频率为 1%）。这些数据（现场发现 O 型和 AB 型血）是否支持“奥利弗是到过现场的两个人之一”这个命题？"],"id":"p059-b010"}]}